    "name": "Cursed Broom",
    "steam_appid": 1823030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/ba96850a2cfa710df836fd786f55c45c.avif?t=1730455737\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly, teleport, and wall-jump your way through increasingly difficult levels. With the Broom, the Hat, and the enchanted Shoes, you\u2019ll unlock powers that make every move feel exhilarating. Master the art of flying and discover new ways to outsmart every obstacle. But watch out, because it looks like that broom might not work as intended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/46874153661d19e3e54b09df4680145f.poster.avif?t=1730455737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/46874153661d19e3e54b09df4680145f.webm?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/46874153661d19e3e54b09df4680145f.mp4?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/c0aabc5d8efdf5ac21e332311722bfe0.avif?t=1730455737\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Maya as she embarks on a journey of self-discovery after an unexpected encounter with the young witch, Robbyn. Together, they hunt down an enchanted runaway printer, face magical challenges and uncover secrets along the way. Will Maya learn to accept who she truly is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/44e87cf83c61120436673f7624e5579e.poster.avif?t=1730455737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/44e87cf83c61120436673f7624e5579e.webm?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/44e87cf83c61120436673f7624e5579e.mp4?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/8aafb763b586a8903b63074e83af7ccf.avif?t=1730455737\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level is packed with secrets and hidden spellbook pages designed to test your skills. You will fail, but with every retry, you\u2019ll get closer to mastering Maya\u2019s powers and claiming every collectable. You enjoy speedruns? Race against the clock! Join our community on Discord to share your best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/b0c62a0a917acc87c74a57e6773828c9.poster.avif?t=1730455737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/b0c62a0a917acc87c74a57e6773828c9.webm?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/b0c62a0a917acc87c74a57e6773828c9.mp4?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/a540a0ee7c2c4c26d07030d87d2a8d3c.avif?t=1730455737\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the grimy depths of the Sewers to the vibrant City streets and the dangers hiding in the Clouds, each level offers a unique atmosphere and thrilling challenges. Every step forward reveals something new to explore! Can you make it to the witch city floating high up in the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/27e0671f6d69d013199f98bc51c2aaaf.poster.avif?t=1730455737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/27e0671f6d69d013199f98bc51c2aaaf.webm?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/27e0671f6d69d013199f98bc51c2aaaf.mp4?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/ba96850a2cfa710df836fd786f55c45c.avif?t=1730455737\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fly, teleport, and wall-jump your way through increasingly difficult levels. With the Broom, the Hat, and the enchanted Shoes, you\u2019ll unlock powers that make every move feel exhilarating. Master the art of flying and discover new ways to outsmart every obstacle. But watch out, because it looks like that broom might not work as intended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/46874153661d19e3e54b09df4680145f.poster.avif?t=1730455737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/46874153661d19e3e54b09df4680145f.webm?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/46874153661d19e3e54b09df4680145f.mp4?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/c0aabc5d8efdf5ac21e332311722bfe0.avif?t=1730455737\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Maya as she embarks on a journey of self-discovery after an unexpected encounter with the young witch, Robbyn. Together, they hunt down an enchanted runaway printer, face magical challenges and uncover secrets along the way. Will Maya learn to accept who she truly is?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/44e87cf83c61120436673f7624e5579e.poster.avif?t=1730455737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/44e87cf83c61120436673f7624e5579e.webm?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/44e87cf83c61120436673f7624e5579e.mp4?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/8aafb763b586a8903b63074e83af7ccf.avif?t=1730455737\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level is packed with secrets and hidden spellbook pages designed to test your skills. You will fail, but with every retry, you\u2019ll get closer to mastering Maya\u2019s powers and claiming every collectable. You enjoy speedruns? Race against the clock! Join our community on Discord to share your best time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/b0c62a0a917acc87c74a57e6773828c9.poster.avif?t=1730455737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/b0c62a0a917acc87c74a57e6773828c9.webm?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/b0c62a0a917acc87c74a57e6773828c9.mp4?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/a540a0ee7c2c4c26d07030d87d2a8d3c.avif?t=1730455737\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the grimy depths of the Sewers to the vibrant City streets and the dangers hiding in the Clouds, each level offers a unique atmosphere and thrilling challenges. Every step forward reveals something new to explore! Can you make it to the witch city floating high up in the sky?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/27e0671f6d69d013199f98bc51c2aaaf.poster.avif?t=1730455737\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/27e0671f6d69d013199f98bc51c2aaaf.webm?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1823030/extras/27e0671f6d69d013199f98bc51c2aaaf.mp4?t=1730455737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p>",
